      "content": "it doesn't feel like i just need a break though. it feels deeper than that. like the actual core of who i am is just... damaged goods. no matter how much i try to \"breathe\" or \"rest,\" the damage is just part of my foundation now. you can't really patch something that's just inherently flawed, you know?",
